## Model card

- **Name:** Xing 4.0 29B-A4B
- **Short description:** China Telecom's open-weight 29B/4B-active text-only Mixture-of-Experts model for coding and terminal agents, Apache 2.0 licensed, Ascend-trained.
- **Provider / access:** Hugging Face open weights (self-host free); free Zen promo tier noted in meta.json.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release date not independently verified. Knowledge cutoff not publicly stated.
- **IDs:** `xing_4.0_29b_a4b` (filesystem slug; HF repo `ChinaTelecomAI/Xing4.0-29B-A4B`).
- **Context window:** 256,000 native (extensible to 512,000 via YaRN) — per repo `meta.json`.
- **Modalities:** text in/out only (per repo `meta.json`).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-17):** Apache 2.0 open weights (self-host free); free Zen promo tier noted.

